            "context": "You have visited Beijing before; this is an experience claim, with no date supplied. Your partner went to Beijing yesterday; that is a particular event. Tell the partner about your own prior experience and distinguish it from their dated trip.\nFamiliar meanings available: travel; go on a trip; Beijing; previously; once.",
